Komikku Page Curl
=================

This product is a modified version of Komikku, and includes material from Komikku,
Mihon and TachiyomiSY.

    Komikku      https://github.com/komikku-app/komikku
    Mihon        https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon
    TachiyomiSY  https://github.com/tachiyomiorg/tachiyomiSY

Modification notice - Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)
-----------------------------------------------------
This repository is a modified copy of the Komikku 1.14.1 sources. The files listed
below have been changed from upstream by lceburn (https://github.com/lceburn), 2026.
Each file also carries inline notices where the change is not self-evident.

Added:
  PAGE_CURL.md
      Design notes for the page-turn animation.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/viewer/pager/CurlGeometry.kt
      Orthographic sheet geometry: a cylinder curl for single pages and a rigid
      spine pivot (optionally carrying that curl) for double-page spreads.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/viewer/pager/PageCurlRenderer.kt
      Depth-sorted, lit triangle mesh renderer with separate artwork per face.
  app/src/test/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/viewer/pager/CurlGeometryTest.kt
      Unit tests for the geometry.

Modified:
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/viewer/pager/Pager.kt
      Drives the animation: gesture tracking, progress, off-thread texture decode.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/viewer/pager/PagerConfig.kt
      Passes the reader canvas colour through to the pager.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/viewer/pager/PagerViewerAdapter.kt
      Exposes the viewer so the pager can read spread settings.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ui/reader/setting/ReaderPreferences.kt
      Preference backing the page-curl toggle.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/presentation/reader/settings/ReadingModePage.kt
      Reader settings UI for the toggle.
  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/presentation/more/settings/screen/SettingsReaderScreen.kt
      Surfaces the reader settings entry.
  i18n-kmk/src/commonMain/moko-resources/base/strings.xml
      Strings for the new setting.
  gradle/libs.versions.toml
      Pins a FlexibleAdapter build that exists on JitPack.

Removed:
  .github/workflows/build_preview.yml, build_release.yml, build_push.yml,
  build_dispatch_preview.yml, update_website.yml, codeberg_mirror.yml,
  build_benchmark.yml
      These upstream workflows depend on secrets held only by the Komikku
      organisation (signing keys, google-services.json, BOT_PAT, CODEBERG_SSH)
      and publish to the Komikku website and Codeberg mirror. They cannot run in
      a fork and failed on every push. They are replaced by two self-contained
      workflows: build_pull_request.yml (format gate + build) and
      build_fork_release.yml (builds and attaches APKs to a release on a v* tag).

No networking, source, extension, or data-layer behaviour is altered by these
changes; they are confined to the horizontal pager reader and its settings.

